flowchart TD

    A([STM32 Boot]) --> B[Initialize HAL]
    B --> C[Initialize MPU-9250]
    C --> D{WHO_AM_I Valid?}

    D -- No --> E[Report Sensor Error via UART]
    E --> C

    D -- Yes --> F[Configure Accelerometer]
    F --> G[Configure Gyroscope]
    G --> H[Start FreeRTOS]

    H --> I[Acquire Sensor Sample]
    I --> J[Store Latest Sensor Values]
    J --> K[Build telem0_packet_t]
    K --> L[Prepare SPI TX Buffer]
    L --> M[Assert DATA_READY]

    M --> N[Jetson GPIO Rising Edge]
    N --> O[Linux Hard IRQ]
    O --> P[Schedule Workqueue]
    P --> Q[SPI Master Transaction]
    Q --> R{MAGIC Valid?}

    R -- No --> S[Drop Packet and Log Error]
    R -- Yes --> T[kfifo_in]
    T --> U[Wake Userspace]
    U --> V[telemetry_reader]
    V --> W[Display Real Sensor Data]

    W --> X{Next Sample}
    X --> I
